<title>BlackoutMode — your laptop lasts through the power outage</title>
<meta name="description" content="BlackoutMode for Windows: when the charger goes dead it cuts the laptop&#x27;s power draw, counts the time left on battery and power bank, and puts everything back when the grid returns. Free, open source.">
